{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#card-zh","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-8r 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）的 Cordis 插件，在本地检查用户消息是否触发 8R 规则，并在匹配时给 AI 回复流添加加粗的「诶！」前缀。插件通过 agent/pre-step 判定消息，在 llm/stream 中按会话和最后一条用户文本匹配后注入前缀；它还监听用户消息事件，并提供 /8r-status 状态诊断接口。规则判定不需要额外 API key 或外部服务。适合希望在 DSH 对话中按本地文字规则自动标记回复的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:228-260","index.js:267-317","index.js:101-124"]}
{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#card-en","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-8r checks DSH user messages locally against 8R rules and prefixes matching replies with bold “诶！”. It judges text at agent/pre-step, then injects into llm/stream when the session and message match. A /8r-status route reports plugin state. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:228-260","index.js:267-317","index.js:101-124"]}
