{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#feature-1","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-8r 的规则判定功能：检查用户文本中的末位辈分单位并给出是否触发的结果。每轮进入 agent/pre-step 时读取最近的用户文本；满足规则后建立待注入状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-96","index.js:228-260"]}
{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#feature-2","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-8r 的回复前缀功能：命中规则后在 llm/stream 输出中添加加粗「诶！」及命中文本摘录。它核对会话 ID 和最后一条用户文本，并处理 text-delta 与 block-end 两类文本块。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:267-302"]}
{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#feature-3","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-8r 的状态诊断功能：插件初始化时尝试注册 /8r-status 路由。访问后返回事件计数、当前路由注册状态以及待处理消息的会话和注入状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:101-124"]}
{"unit_id":"SensenMeng__dsh-plugin-8r#caveat-1","repo":"SensenMeng/dsh-plugin-8r","commit":"fe5dc10ead94156a880bffaa60d52b2c417373f6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-8r 使用流式注入前缀，前缀会进入会话记录；代码只在匹配会话的回复流中添加文本。见 index.js:267-317。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:267-317"]}
